{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Git & Collaboration Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Configure git"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git config --global user.name \"Your Name\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git config --global user.email \"you@example.com\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: The daily workflow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git add file.py"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git commit -m \"Add perceptron implementation\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git push origin main"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Branching for experiments"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git checkout -b experiment/new-optimizer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# ... make changes, commit ..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git checkout main"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git merge experiment/new-optimizer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Working with this course repo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git clone https://github.com/rohitg00/ai-engineering-from-scratch.git"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "cd ai-engineering-from-scratch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git checkout -b my-progress"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# work through lessons, commit your code"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "git push origin my-progress"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Clone this repo, create a branch called `my-progress`, make a file, commit it, push it\n2. Create a `.gitignore` that excludes model checkpoint files (`.pt`, `.pth`, `.safetensors`)\n3. Look at the commit history of this repo with `git log --oneline` and read how lessons were added"
      ]
    }
  ],
